OwnTV: revert mpv 13a4bfbc1 "demux_lavf: read HLS and DASH manifests through the stream".

With it, mpv fetches the HLS/DASH playlist itself and FFmpeg only opens the segments, so FFmpeg
never sees the playlist response (cookies, redirect-bound tokens) and IPTV panels that tie segment
access to it answer 403 Forbidden on every segment. Found on the TCL, 2026-09-25 (B4U Music; the same
channel plays on ExoPlayer and on mpv 0.41.0). Drop this patch once upstream fixes it — UPDATING.md.

diff --git a/demux/demux_lavf.c b/demux/demux_lavf.c
